<!doctype html>
<html dir="ltr" lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
  <title>Réservation de visite guidée EPFL</title>

  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://epfl-si.github.io/elements/svg/epfl-logo.svg" />

  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'Arial';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      mso-font-alt: 'Helvetica';
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: rgb(241,245,249);
      font-family: 'Arial', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI Symbol", "Noto Color Emoji";
      color: rgb(0,0,0);
    }

    .wrapper {
      padding: 24px 0;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 42.5rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: rgb(255,255,255);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .header {
      padding: 1rem 2rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    .header img {
      display: inline-block;
      outline: none;
      border: none;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 8px;
      height: 32px;
      width: 110px;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 37.5em;
      margin: 0 auto 1rem auto;
      padding: 0 0.75rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .intro {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .signature {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 24px;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgb(209,213,220);
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .data-grid {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .data-grid td {
      width: 33.3333%;
      padding: 4px 0;
    }

    .data-grid td:nth-child(1) { text-align: left; }
    .data-grid td:nth-child(2) { text-align: center; }
    .data-grid td:nth-child(3) { text-align: right; }

    .footer {
      max-width: 37.5em;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: rgb(249,250,251);
      padding: 1rem;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .footer p {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1rem;
      color: rgb(159,159,169);
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container" role="article">
      <div class="header">
        <img alt="EPFL" src="https://epfl-si.github.io/elements/svg/epfl-logo.svg" />
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h1>Réservation de visite guidée</h1>
        <p class="intro">
          Bonjour Laurent Houtan, <br />
          Nous avons bien reçu votre demande de réservation pour :
        </p>
        <table class="data-grid" role="presentation">
          <tr>
            <td>Visite</td>
            <td>Nombre de personnes</td>
            <td>Date</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <hr class="divider" />
        <table class="data-grid" role="presentation">
          <tr>
            <td>Campus EPFL (Standard)</td>
            <td>10</td>
            <td>Mon Oct 12 2026</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <hr class="divider" />
        <p>Nous traiterons votre demande dans les plus brefs délais.</p>
        <p class="signature">L'équipe des visites guidées</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          Mediacom - École polytechnique fédérale de Lausanne<br />
          EPFL P-MEDIACOM, CM 2 360, Station 10, CH-1015 Lausanne
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
